cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the OAL reference model when discussing or adapting its rules."
title: "OAL: Open Analysis Layers — Alpha-v0.1.0-Alkimim"
type: software
version: Alpha-v0.1.0-Alkimim
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Alkimim
    given-names: Douglas de Oliveira
  - family-names: Chevitarese
    given-names: Bruno
abstract: >-
  A reference model connecting use-case specification (UCS),
  a program model (ADPM), verification specification (ADVS),
  implementation (ADI), and interaction boundaries (ADIB) through
  accountable derivations and traceable case-to-interface mappings.
keywords:
  - use cases
  - requirements engineering
  - verification
  - software architecture
  - traceability
